{{{{{1<noinclude>|Ability data</noinclude>}}}|Realm Warp|{{{2|}}}|{{{3|}}}|{{{4|}}}|{{{5|}}}
|champion     = Ryze
|skill        = R
|icon         = false
|blurb        = {{sbc|Passive:}} ''{{ais|Overload|Ryze}}'' ''{{ai|Spell Flux|Ryze|Flux}}'' empowered damage is increased.
|blurb2       = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|Ryze}} {{tip|channel|channels}} for a short time to open a portal beneath him. '''Ryze''' can act during the channel, but the portal will cancel if he is {{tip|interrupt|interrupted}}.
|blurb3       = Upon completion, allies within the portal will {{tip|blink}} to the target location.
|description  = {{sbc|Passive:}} ''{{ais|Overload|Ryze}}'' ''{{ai|Spell Flux|Ryze|Flux}}'' empowered damage is increased.
|leveling     = {{st|Bonus Overload Damage|{{ap|50 to 100}}%}}
|icon2        = Realm Warp.png
|description2 = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Ryze''' {{tip|channel|channels}} for 2 seconds to open a portal beneath him, marking the target location as its destination and granting {{tip|sight}} of the target area. '''Ryze''' is able to act while channeling, but the portal will cancel if he is {{tip|interrupt|interrupted}}.
|description3 = Upon completion, '''Ryze''' and all allied units within the portal will {{tip|blink}} to the location and become {{tip|root|rooted}}, {{tip|disarm|disarmed}}, {{tip|silence|silenced}} and {{tip|untargetable}} for {{tt|{{fd|0.75}}|Estimated}} seconds.
|cooldown     = {{ap|180 to 140}}
|cost         = 100
|cast time    = none
|costtype     = Mana
|target range = {{dv|{{tt|1000|Minimum cast range}}|{{tt|3000|Maximum cast range}}}}
|effect radius= {{dv|{{tip|cr|icononly = true}} {{tt|465|Portal radius}}|{{tip|sight|icononly = true}}{{tt|515|Destination area reveal radius during channel}}}}
|targeting    = Location
|affects      = Allies
|grounded     = true
|silence      = true
|outofrange   = cast at max
|notes        = 
* Blinked units retain the same relative positions to one another upon arrival.
* ''Realm Warp'' will teleport allies even if they are in a {{tip|zombie state}}, are {{tip|untargetable}}, or are affected by {{tip|crowd control}}.
* ''Realm Warp'' will not teleport allies that are using an ability that preloads {{tip|unstoppableforcemarker|UnstoppableForceMarker}} or are being affected by another ally's ''Realm Warp'' first.
* ''Realm Warp'' will still teleport an allied {{ui|Rift Herald}} that is winding up its leap.
* ''Realm Warp'' has various interactions with {{tip|channel|channeled}} abilities that are being performed by an ally. Some channels will prevent their caster from being teleported and others will not.
** For channels that do not prevent the teleport, ''Realm Warp'' will specifically not apply its {{tip|silence}} to the caster.
** Cast times will not prevent the teleport.
** The following channels will prevent the teleport:
*** {{cai|R|Caitlyn}}
*** {{cai|R|Galio}}
*** {{cai|R|Kayn}}
*** {{cai|R|Jhin}}
*** {{cai|Q|Warwick}}
*** {{cai|R|Xerath}}
*** {{si|Recall}} / {{si|Empowered Recall}}
*** {{si|Teleport}} / {{si|Unleashed Teleport}}
* The following table refers for interactions while '''Ryze''' is {{tip|channel|channeling}}:
{{ct|channel|attack=true|move=true|cast=true|items=true,,interrupts|spells=true|interrupts=silence,root,revival-false, ground}}
